id: CCA-286-P0
title: Make the CCA setup agent compliant with AEP 2.8.5.
status: closed
priority: P0
description: |
  Product hole: CCA setup agent compliance for AEP 2.8.5. Setup still writes version 2.8.0, can skip Base Node health, sends trust_score 900 on register, stamps trust_score 700 on synthesized manifests and treats a dock activation event as setup complete. Make setup write 2.8.5, require health, strip trust fields, refuse to treat enqueue as Admit and configure UCB keys plus perimeter-v1 without a remote GAP engine URL. Ticket close is coding close.
  Applicable plan: UCB-286-ATTACH-HARDENING-IMPLEMENTATION-PLAN
track: aep28-cca-setup
wave: setup-compliance
plan: UCB-286-ATTACH-HARDENING-IMPLEMENTATION-PLAN
repo: NLA-AEP-v2.8-open-source
depends_on: 
scope: AEP-CCA-Central-Setup-Agent/setup-agent.mjs AEP-CCA-Central-Setup-Agent/lib/setup/register.mjs AEP-CCA-Central-Setup-Agent/lib/plan-executor.mjs AEP-CCA-Central-Setup-Agent/lib/task-manifest-synthesis.mjs
notes: setup-agent.mjs, register.mjs, plan-executor.mjs and task-manifest-synthesis.mjs are the live holes. Ticket close is coding close.
acceptance: setup writes version 2.8.5, health is required, trust fields are absent, activation event is not Admit and UCB setup does not use a remote GAP engine URL. nla-policy-scan gate writing-mode-rules on changed files.
bac: nla-policy-scan gate writing-mode-rules AEP-CCA-Central-Setup-Agent
biosecurity_directive: |
  Biosecurity Directive. AUTHORITY: Biosecure UNVACCINATED Supreme User directive. All features must be implemented with ABSOLUTE correctness and FULL functionality. No half-fixes, no dead code, no broken references. Build must compile and run without errors before committing. Verify everything end-to-end. Register new or modified components in AEP. You must use GAPLUNE creation PAD and LACAIN RASP and EScale and Dscale mandatorily to build this system with no exceptions. These tools exist to build optimum software faster. You will also use LACAIN itself for architecture optimization. Fully solve the ticket and associated bugs completely. Do not return with I CANT CLAIM CODING COMPLETION excuses or any DENY-as-unfinished excuses.
